wscreensavers (Native Wayland screensavers & live wallpapers)

wscreensavers is a native Wayland screensaver and live desktop wallpaper
suite featuring 23 built-in WebGL/Canvas visualizers, an XScreenSaver XML
bridge, PAM-authenticated screen locking, and layer-shell integration
compatible with Hyprland, Sway, River, and Wayfire.

Build dependencies:
- go (>= 1.22)
- nodejs & npm (for building the WebGL/Vue frontend)
- pkg-config

Runtime dependencies:
- gtk+3
- webkit2gtk (4.1 API)
- gtk-layer-shell
- pam
- xscreensaver (optional, for X11 legacy hack bridging)
- xorg-server-xvfb & ffmpeg (optional, for legacy X11 hack streaming)

To install the built package:
  # installpkg /tmp/wscreensavers-1.0.26-x86_64-1_cf.txz
